# What the M8 demo must show, in order. The shim's own lines land on the
# prompt line, and the typed echo follows them, so keys omit the prompts where
# the recording puts them on a line of their own.
elixos-shim: pid 1, version
elixos-shim: launching generation=0 mode=normal
iex(1)> x = 41
41
iex(2)> elixos-shim: re-exec after panic: test hook: shim_panic_after
elixos-shim: adopting beam pid=
x + 1
42
elixos-shim: shutdown poweroff
